## Implemented boundary

`TeamTaskRuntime` now owns separate `members`, `tasks`, `workflowPlans`, and provider-owned `artifacts` collection states with independent cursor, loading, loadingMore, error, and hasNewer fields. Member/task/artifact pages use the existing Host list methods with an explicit limit of 64; Host filters private and ambiguous artifact references before the artifact page is exposed. Selection changes and late responses are fenced by the existing selection generation. TeamPage consumes the collection rows when available and retains the authoritative full snapshot for mutation/compatibility fallback. Full browser/GIF coverage remains separate T-06 work.
